%% Status: CURRENT — deployed source verified
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as AuthForm
  participant Fn as username-login
  participant Admin as Trusted Supabase client
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  UI->>Fn: normalized username + password
  Fn->>Fn: validate ^[a-z0-9._-]{3,30}$
  Fn->>Admin: resolve profile user_id and account email
  Fn->>Auth: signInWithPassword via public client
  Auth-->>Fn: session or generic invalid credentials
  Fn-->>UI: session tokens only on success
